    "sentence_translations": [
      "This Is My Rice",
      "",
      "Today was Sunday. The weather was very hot.",
      "",
      "Today nobody came to the school. There was no food at the school.",
      "",
      "Me and Fanfan didn’t eat the day before yesterday, nor did we eat yesterday. We really wanted to eat!",
      "",
      "Me and Fanfan went to the restaurant. The restaurant didn’t have any rice.",
      "",
      "Me and Fanfan went to the hospital. The hospital also didn’t have any rice.",
      "",
      "At one store, Fanfan saw that there was rice. We were very happy.",
      "",
      "We were in the middle of eating rice.",
      "At this time, a big cat came. He said, “This is my place! This is my rice! You must not eat it!”"
    ]
